奏。整體還是不錯的\n\n價格都不貴，有開發票能刷載具。\n店員服務也很好，也認真介紹餐點。\n此寶藏店家，兩次去都沒啥人蠻特別的。\n\n推推",null,[0,46]]]],[null,1767957713000000,1767957713000000,"7 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfank3OWJRTVhQd0tnOEZ4LTg2RHFqdw%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfank3OWJRTVhQd0tnOEZ4LTg2RHFqdxoTQ2d3STBjbUR5d1lROElLSjN3RQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj8xezWw9KWAxXAoa8BHdnpKaAQ_2MIeygN"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvZVdKc1VtcFNNMFpDVVdwS1dHRklTblpoVjJob1dqTlNhMW94UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvZVdKc1VtcFNNMFpDVVdwS1dHRklTblpoVjJob1dqTlNhMW94UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvZVdKc1VtcFNNMFpDVVdwS1dHRklTblpoVjJob1dqTlNhMW94UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvZVdKc1VtcFNNMFpDVVdwS1dHRklTblpoVjJob1dqTlNhMW94UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvZVdKc1VtcFNNMFpDVVdwS1dHRklTblpoVjJob1dqTlNhMW94UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRvZVdKc1VtcFNNMFpDVVdwS1dHRklTblpoVjJob1dqTlNhMW94UlJBQhAA"],null,["zh-Hant"],[["感謝您的肯定～\n能吃到喜歡的店家不用久候\n是最幸福的事情\n我們會持續努力推出\n更令人驚豔的餐點\n歡迎下次再來～\n",null,[0,28]]]],[null,null,13208,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2toeWJsUmpSM0ZCUWpKWGFISnZhV2hoWjNSa1oxRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x63c1e169941980af!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkhyblRjR3FBQjJXaHJvaWhhZ3RkZ1E%7C%7C?hl\u003dzh-TW"],["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?p