E_NO_WAIT"],"不需等候",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwj8xezWw9KWAxXAoa8BHdnpKaAQ3YcHCOIBKAA"]],1],null,null,"等待時間",null,"0ahUKEwj8xezWw9KWAxXAoa8BHdnpKaAQ3IcHCOEBKA4",null,null,null,null,null,3,null,2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["店家提供的菜單上的餐點⭐號是 濃郁度而非推薦度🤣\n\n2025/09/28 初訪\n*鹽味雞豚清湯拉麵\n濃度1⭐的淡麗清爽的湯頭，鮮明的鹽味和多層的香氣形成的溫和口味讓人滿足。雞肉軟嫩真的讓人驚艷，豬叉燒看起來瘦卻充滿均勻的油脂，吃起來很不錯。\n\n*激辛蝦醬拉麵\n雖然是5⭐濃度但其實沒有想像中的濃郁，鹹度適中並不算高，而辣度大概中辣至小辣的程度，依然是大眾普遍可以接受的口味，但對重口味的人來說會不太夠。湯頭並非單純直直的蝦味，而是蝦和魚乾及其他海鮮的融合口味。\n\n目前來說可能更喜歡鹽味雞豚清湯，也很期待再次來訪嘗試其他口味。",null,[0,39]]]],[null,1762520112000000,1762520112000000,"9 個月前",["https://www.google.com/local/content/rap/report?postId\u003d5@1:CAEQrcz1_gkiGwoZQ0hfakNTcURSSDRHZFlHMnZ6LTdOUGdmUQ%7CCAEQrcz1_gkiMAoZQ0hfakNTcURSSDRHZFlHMnZ6LTdOUGdmURoTQ2d3SXNOaTN5QVlRN28tODVnRQ\u0026t\u003d7\u0026wv\u003d1\u0026d\u003d286732320",null,null,"0ahUKEwj8xezWw9KWAxXAoa8BHdnpKaAQ_2MI4wEoDw"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3UjJFeVNtbFJiWGgzWTBack0yRnJkRVJWYWxwcFkydGplRkV4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3UjJFeVNtbFJiWGgzWTBack0yRnJkRVJWYWxwcFkydGplRkV4UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3UjJFeVNtbFJiWGgzWTBack0yRnJkRVJWYWxwcFkydGplRkV4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3UjJFeVNtbFJiWGgzWTBack0yRnJkRVJWYWxwcFkydGplRkV4UlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3UjJFeVNtbFJiWGgzWTBack0yRnJkRVJWYWxwcFkydGplRkV4UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/1673217787433930251/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjF3UjJFeVNtbFJiWGgzWTBack0yRnJkRVJW